# EXPRESS-009 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:9
#    port 3000: working catalog (p1 … p8), port 3001: catalog that always throws
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").

@ok = http://localhost:3000
@broken = http://localhost:3001

### All products (expect 200, p1 … p8)
GET {{ok}}/products

### One product (expect 200)
GET {{ok}}/products/p5

### Unknown id (expect 404)
GET {{ok}}/products/p99

### Catalog down (expect 500 { "error": "Something went wrong" }, no "products-db" in the body)
GET {{broken}}/products

### Catalog down, one product (expect 500)
GET {{broken}}/products/p5
